[{"id":2730676297,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6iwtBJ","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Code looks good to me, but I don't have an iOS device to test this.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104857#pullrequestreview-2730676297","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104857","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-03-31T22:38:12Z"},{"id":2731763537,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6i02dR","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?u=2867ee7fcd920bc19b7d1cbf4b10264b9bbc9326&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","login":"bruvzg","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg"},"body":"Looks fine, but I do not have anything to test it with.\r\n\r\nSince you are changing this code, it probably worth replacing `__MAC_OS_X_VERSION_MIN_REQUIRED` (which only suppresses warnings) with runtime checks:\r\n\r\n```obj-c++\r\n\tNSArray<AVCaptureDevice *> *devices = nullptr;\r\n#if defined(__x86_64__)\r\n\tif (@available(macOS 10.15, *)) {\r\n#endif\r\n\t\tAVCaptureDeviceDiscoverySession *session;\r\n\t\tif (@available(macOS 14.0, *)) {\r\n\t\t\tsession = [AVCaptureDeviceDiscoverySession discoverySessionWithDeviceTypes:[NSArray arrayWithObjects:AVCaptureDeviceTypeExternal, AVCaptureDeviceTypeBuiltInWideAngleCamera, AVCaptureDeviceTypeContinuityCamera, nil] mediaType:AVMediaTypeVideo position:AVCaptureDevicePositionUnspecified];\r\n\t\t} else {\r\n\t\t\tsession = [AVCaptureDeviceDiscoverySession discoverySessionWithDeviceTypes:[NSArray arrayWithObjects:AVCaptureDeviceTypeExternalUnknown, AVCaptureDeviceTypeBuiltInWideAngleCamera, nil] mediaType:AVMediaTypeVideo position:AVCaptureDevicePositionUnspecified];\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\tdevices = session.devices;\r\n#if defined(__x86_64__)\r\n\t} else {\r\n\t\tdevices = [AVCaptureDevice devicesWithMediaType:AVMediaTypeVideo];\r\n\t}\r\n#endif\r\n```\r\n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104857#pullrequestreview-2731763537","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104857","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-04-01T08:10:41Z"},{"id":2732398671,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6i3RhP","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","login":"shiena","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104857#pullrequestreview-2732398671","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104857","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-04-01T11:38:05Z"},{"id":2732522370,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6i3vuC","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"e37d785a0a7f41d37aa42fe3689e86f322c13dc3","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?u=2867ee7fcd920bc19b7d1cbf4b1026